  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading of Millosheve-Mitrovica M2 Main Road (26.7KM) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the Project is to contribute to the economic development and employment generation in the Districts of Kosovska Mitrovica and Prishtina. Improved road connectivity and capacity enhancement will facilitate the movement of people and goods and reduce road traffic casualties, vehicle operating costs, travel time and road congestion. The development will generate new business and employment opportunities in the project area.</narrative>
  </description>
